  acu_roundtrip_first.adam - a dep test (adamtest's deps) of
  driver\acu_roundtrip (PLAN-ADAM SU2.2): built only, so fixtures\AcuRtUnit
  is compiled from its source the first time and its .acu is in the output
  folder's acu\x86_64-windows-gnu\debug\ before acu_roundtrip builds
